  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Shine bright with our Holographic Bow Glitter Phone Case, designed for those who love a touch of glam. Featuring a dazzling holographic finish with a chic 3D bow embellishment, this case instantly elevates your phone’s look. Made from durable TPU material, it offers reliable protection against scratches and minor drops while staying lightweight and stylish. Pair it with the attached pearl bracelet chain for extra charm and convenience. Perfect for parties, special occasions, or adding sparkle to your everyday style.",
  "description_html": "<p>Shine bright with our Holographic Bow Glitter Phone Case, designed for those who love a touch of glam. Featuring a dazzling holographic finish with a chic 3D bow embellishment, this case instantly elevates your phone’s look. Made from durable TPU material, it offers reliable protection against scratches and minor drops while staying lightweight and stylish. Pair it with the attached pearl bracelet chain for extra charm and convenience. Perfect for parties, special occasions, or adding sparkle to your everyday style.</p>"
